description=B42 bug-fix fork of GaelGunStore-Firearms.\n\nOriginal mod, all weapons, models and assets: Pen-Pen Pirulin.\nFramework: AWCWF (Advanced Warfare Community Weapons FrameWork).\n\n*** TEMPORARY / INTERIM USE ***\nI am trying to contact the original author (Pen-Pen Pirulin) to send these fixes for the official mod. This fork is only a stopgap until the official mod is updated for B42 -- please switch back to it once that happens.\n\nThis fork ONLY fixes B42 bugs:\n- reload "surrender" animation\n- item names showing as Base.xxx\n- magazine not rendering on the gun\n- lever / MK18 fire contortion\n- attachment removal\n\nv1.4.1 (latest):\n- multiplayer: duplicate weapon parts from attach/remove cycles fixed (in-hand items were invisible to ownership checks; both sides handed back copies; fresh parts came back at 100%)\n\nv1.4:\n- multiplayer attachments: attaching did nothing, removal left the part on the gun, suppressors stayed loud, ghost parts stuck on the player model, duplicate parts handed out -- all fixed (server + client work now agree)\n\nv1.3:\n- attachment positions on sawn-off Browning Auto-5, Becker, MTS-255\n- Remington Model 8 grip / scope / bipod positions\n- Remington 121 scope position\n- Remington 870 sawn-off can now take a buttstock\n- QBS-09 buttstock slot removed\n- suppressor blocked on more sawn-off shotguns\n- AAC Honey Badger foregrip + LVOA bipod positions\n- HKG28 bipod position\n- ENARM Pentagun & Jackhammer: proper Auto/Single fire mode (were single-only, fired uncontrolled full-auto when kitted)\n\nv1.2:\n- attachment & magazine models not showing on weapons\n- "Single" fire mode firing full-auto / faster than Auto\n- JS-2000 / Ithaca M37 sawn-off shotgun: no model + could not fire\n- more grenades & gun tools showing as Base.xxx\n- inspect / attach UI crash without -debug\n- M1887 attachment positions\n\nFull credit to the original author. All original content belongs to its respective authors.